{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs34 yb-Reference practice shelf\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 This repository serves disposable {\b yb-Reference TEST} packages for installation and update rehearsals. It is not the beta or release shelf.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Use these packages only in a portable or otherwise disposable REAPER installation. Do not install them over your normal yb-Reference copy.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Install the current practice package\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab 1.\tab} In REAPER, choose {\b Extensions \u8594 ? ReaPack \u8594 ? Import repositories\u8230 ?}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab 2.\tab} Paste:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li360 \ls1\ilvl0\fi0 \f1 \fs24 https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ybresley/yb-Reference-practice-shelf/main/index.xml\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab 3.\tab} Choose {\b Extensions \u8594 ? ReaPack \u8594 ? Browse packages\u8230 ?}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab 4.\tab} Search for {\b yb-Reference TEST}.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab 5.\tab} Select it, choose {\b Install}, then select {\b Apply}.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab 6.\tab} Restart REAPER.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab 7.\tab} Open the Action List and run {\b yb-Reference TEST \u183 ? packaging rehearsal}.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Search for {\b ToggleReferenceMode} in the Action List to find the companion TEST action and assign it to a temporary hotkey.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Current rehearsal\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls2\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} TEST package: {\b 0.2.12}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls2\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} Source snapshot: clean {\f1 \fs24 main} commit {\f1 \fs24 fbcf00c}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls2\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} Automated checks: {\b 700 passed, 0 failed}\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Every changed TEST build gets a new version number. Existing versions are not silently replaced, so an installed copy and its feedback reports can always be identified.\par}
